{"seq":1,"slug":"early-life","title":"早年与启蒙","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/warren-buffett/life-and-times/early-life","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"childhood-in-omaha","title":"奥马哈的童年","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/warren-buffett/life-and-times/early-life/childhood-in-omaha","wordCount":1466,"readingTime":6},{"seq":2,"slug":"the-young-capitalist","title":"少年资本家","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/warren-buffett/life-and-times/early-life/the-young-capitalist","wordCount":1506,"readingTime":7}],"introMarkdown":"# 早年与启蒙\n\n巴菲特的投资天赋，在奥马哈的童年与少年时代便已萌发。本章回顾他人生的起点。\n\n第一篇文档讲述\"奥马哈的童年\"——这座中部小城如何塑造他低调、理性而专注的品格。第二篇文档讲述\"少年资本家\",呈现他早熟的生意经、第一支股票的得失，与对复利的痴迷。\n"}